## 常用下载源

### NVIDIA 官方
- CUDA Toolkit: https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-downloads
- CUDA Archive: https://developer.nvidia.com/cuda-toolkit-archive
- NVIDIA Driver: https://www.nvidia.com/download/index.aspx
- Tesla Driver: https://www.nvidia.com/download/find.aspx?q=tesla

### MLNX OFED
- 官方下载: https://network.nvidia.com/products/infiniband-drivers/linux/mlnx_ofed/
- 历史版本: https://www.mellanox.com/page/products_dyn?product_family=26&mtag=linux_sw_drivers

### 国内镜像
- 阿里云: https://mirrors.aliyun.com/nvidia-cuda/
- 清华: https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/nvidia-cuda/